1
00:00:51,360 --> 00:00:53,040
This bastard won't say a word.

2
00:00:53,800 --> 00:00:55,320
I've been asking for ages, and he only says two things:

3
00:00:55,320 --> 00:00:57,450
'I don't know' and 'I don't remember'.

4
00:00:59,840 --> 00:01:01,700
I found some clues from back then.

5
00:01:02,080 --> 00:01:04,140
It might be related to a batch of wood.

6
00:01:13,760 --> 00:01:15,760
I came to Xinchun just to buy timber.

7
00:01:22,880 --> 00:01:23,560
Ma.

8
00:01:24,480 --> 00:01:25,920
You and the others interrogate him first.

9
00:01:25,920 --> 00:01:27,320
I need to go find someone.

10
00:01:27,960 --> 00:01:28,640
Okay.

11
00:01:31,240 --> 00:01:32,160
Liu Guang.

12
00:01:32,680 --> 00:01:34,880
What's the point of holding out now?

13
00:01:35,720 --> 00:01:38,280
It's only a matter of time before we find your boss, you know?

14
00:01:38,280 --> 00:01:39,479
If you confess now,

15
00:01:39,479 --> 00:01:41,320
you can get a reduced sentence.

16
00:01:41,320 --> 00:01:42,050
Understand?

17
00:01:42,280 --> 00:01:43,740
Think about your brother.

18
00:01:44,479 --> 00:01:46,140
He died an unexplained death.

19
00:01:46,320 --> 00:01:49,580
Are you sure this batch of timber has nothing to do with him?

20
00:01:50,120 --> 00:01:51,580
Think about it carefully.

21
00:01:53,720 --> 00:01:54,840
I told you.

22
00:01:56,120 --> 00:01:58,050
Can my sentence really be reduced?

23
00:02:05,160 --> 00:02:06,000
Officer Cao.

24
00:02:08,039 --> 00:02:09,000
Is it convenient

25
00:02:09,479 --> 00:02:10,320
to talk?

26
00:02:10,600 --> 00:02:11,360
It's convenient.

27
00:02:11,360 --> 00:02:12,680
Let's go inside and talk.

28
00:02:12,680 --> 00:02:13,200
No need.

29
00:02:20,040 --> 00:02:22,170
There's progress on Liu Guang's case.

30
00:02:26,280 --> 00:02:27,680
You seem to care

31
00:02:28,160 --> 00:02:29,240
a lot about this.

32
00:02:29,560 --> 00:02:30,480
I provided the clue.

33
00:02:30,480 --> 00:02:31,600
Of course I care.

34
00:02:32,120 --> 00:02:32,720
By the way,

35
00:02:33,120 --> 00:02:34,880
I haven't had the chance to thank you, Mr. Wang,

36
00:02:34,880 --> 00:02:36,280
for providing the clue

37
00:02:36,520 --> 00:02:37,600
to catch Liu Guang.

38
00:02:42,480 --> 00:02:44,240
You're too polite, Officer Cao.

39
00:02:44,240 --> 00:02:45,560
Where did you get

40
00:02:46,680 --> 00:02:47,540
that clue from?

41
00:02:50,360 --> 00:02:51,280
By chance.

42
00:02:53,040 --> 00:02:54,680
How much do you know

43
00:02:56,520 --> 00:02:58,320
about the old incidents in Xinchun?

44
00:02:58,320 --> 00:02:59,180
Old incidents?

45
00:03:00,080 --> 00:03:01,240
Sixteen years ago,

46
00:03:01,840 --> 00:03:03,600
there was a car bombing

47
00:03:04,480 --> 00:03:05,520
in Xinchun.

48
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:07,400
There is no record of it

49
00:03:07,400 --> 00:03:09,280
in the police archives.

50
00:03:09,840 --> 00:03:11,770
There are only two possibilities.

51
00:03:11,800 --> 00:03:12,360
First,

52
00:03:13,440 --> 00:03:15,440
the victim didn't want to report it.

53
00:03:16,200 --> 00:03:16,760
Second,

54
00:03:17,600 --> 00:03:19,160
the victim is already dead.

55
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:21,000
Mr. Wang,

56
00:03:21,440 --> 00:03:22,760
help me analyze this.

57
00:03:23,320 --> 00:03:25,380
In the car bombing sixteen years ago,

58
00:03:26,079 --> 00:03:27,610
two victims were disabled.

59
00:03:28,520 --> 00:03:29,920
That's really all I know.

60
00:03:33,760 --> 00:03:35,200
You are so obsessed

61
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:37,079
with Korean pine,

62
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:40,329
and you are also particularly interested

63
00:03:41,040 --> 00:03:43,040
in what happened sixteen years ago.

64
00:03:43,600 --> 00:03:45,200
Before Liu Guang was caught,

65
00:03:45,440 --> 00:03:48,000
your people found his illegal workshop first

66
00:03:48,320 --> 00:03:50,920
and found the remnants of that old Korean pine.

67
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:52,280
I'm very curious.

68
00:03:53,360 --> 00:03:54,440
Mr. Wang,

69
00:03:55,720 --> 00:03:57,200
are you looking for wood,

70
00:03:57,600 --> 00:04:00,600
or the people and things behind the wood?

71
00:04:03,400 --> 00:04:04,480
Sixteen years ago,

72
00:04:05,400 --> 00:04:08,480
there was also a gas cylinder explosion in Xinchun.

73
00:04:08,960 --> 00:04:11,220
You must know something about it, right?

74
00:04:18,040 --> 00:04:18,839
Wang Hong,

75
00:04:20,040 --> 00:04:21,560
who exactly are you?

76
00:04:29,080 --> 00:04:30,080
Let me take a call.

77
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:33,760
Wang Hong,

78
00:04:34,240 --> 00:04:35,560
Chen Lu and her little brat

79
00:04:35,560 --> 00:04:36,880
are in my hands now.

80
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:38,760
If you don't want them to disappear,

81
00:04:38,760 --> 00:04:39,840
come alone.

82
00:04:40,400 --> 00:04:41,880
If I see a second person,

83
00:04:42,080 --> 00:04:44,409
you can just wait to collect their bodies.

84
00:04:49,400 --> 00:04:50,130
Officer Cao.

85
00:04:50,520 --> 00:04:51,680
Something urgent came up.

86
00:04:51,680 --> 00:04:53,540
I have to go. Let's talk next time.

87
00:05:00,680 --> 00:05:01,320
Master Hu.

88
00:05:02,720 --> 00:05:04,280
If we don't leave now, it'll be too late.

89
00:05:04,280 --> 00:05:07,210
The Forest Security people could arrive at any time.

90
00:05:07,360 --> 00:05:08,560
Is the car ready?

91
00:05:08,560 --> 00:05:10,000
It's ready. It's at the back door.

92
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:10,560
It's fully fueled.

93
00:05:10,560 --> 00:05:12,760
And it has out-of-town license plates.

94
00:05:14,840 --> 00:05:16,170
Put this in your pocket.

95
00:05:17,200 --> 00:05:17,920
Put it away.

96
00:05:21,600 --> 00:05:22,600
You guys go first.

97
00:05:23,400 --> 00:05:24,530
You're not leaving?

98
00:05:24,800 --> 00:05:26,240
I haven't found Xiaohu yet.

99
00:05:26,240 --> 00:05:27,300
He's my lifeblood.

100
00:05:28,680 --> 00:05:30,080
What will he do if I leave?

101
00:05:30,240 --> 00:05:31,600
We don't have time for this.

102
00:05:31,600 --> 00:05:32,480
Master Hu, listen to me.

103
00:05:32,480 --> 00:05:33,320
Where there is life,

104
00:05:33,320 --> 00:05:34,120
there is hope.

105
00:05:34,120 --> 00:05:35,800
We still have a chance if we leave now.

106
00:05:35,800 --> 00:05:36,600
Listen to me.

107
00:05:37,360 --> 00:05:38,560
You drive away first.

108
00:05:39,080 --> 00:05:40,610
Wait for us at the old place.

109
00:05:41,120 --> 00:05:42,240
By noon tomorrow,

110
00:05:42,240 --> 00:05:43,300
if we don't show up,

111
00:05:44,400 --> 00:05:45,800
drive away immediately.

112
00:05:46,159 --> 00:05:47,090
Never come back.

113
00:05:51,280 --> 00:05:51,880
Master Hu.

114
00:05:54,200 --> 00:05:56,659
I, Ahui, have followed you for so many years.

115
00:05:57,080 --> 00:05:58,409
Through thick and thin,

116
00:05:58,520 --> 00:06:00,160
I've seen it all.

117
00:06:00,840 --> 00:06:01,900
If you don't leave,

118
00:06:01,960 --> 00:06:02,880
I won't leave either.

119
00:06:02,880 --> 00:06:04,440
I'll stay and help you find Xiaohu.

120
00:06:04,440 --> 00:06:05,200
Do as I say.

121
00:06:05,440 --> 00:06:06,280
I won't.

122
00:06:07,480 --> 00:06:08,040
Go.

123
00:06:08,240 --> 00:06:08,880
I'm not leaving.

124
00:06:08,880 --> 00:06:10,280
Go, go, go.

125
00:06:10,280 --> 00:06:11,810
I'm not leaving, Master Hu.

126
00:06:15,320 --> 00:06:16,250
My good brother.

127
00:06:17,680 --> 00:06:18,200
Go.

128
00:06:25,400 --> 00:06:26,000
Master Hu.

129
00:06:28,720 --> 00:06:30,720
I'll wait for you at the usual place.

130
00:06:48,920 --> 00:06:49,560
It's okay.

131
00:06:51,400 --> 00:06:52,330
Don't be afraid.

132
00:06:59,400 --> 00:07:00,330
What's going on?

133
00:07:01,240 --> 00:07:02,120
Teng Xiaohu!

134
00:07:02,600 --> 00:07:03,920
Are you crazy?

135
00:07:04,200 --> 00:07:05,640
Why did you tie us up?

136
00:07:06,680 --> 00:07:07,560
Teng Xiaohu!

137
00:07:07,960 --> 00:07:09,160
Are you a man?

138
00:07:09,480 --> 00:07:10,680
My mom is already like this.

139
00:07:10,680 --> 00:07:11,880
And I'm just a kid.

140
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:12,960
If you want to take revenge on society,

141
00:07:12,960 --> 00:07:14,400
find someone tough!

142
00:07:14,520 --> 00:07:15,480
Shut up!

143
00:07:17,240 --> 00:07:19,770
Why didn't you say that when I was tying you up?

144
00:07:20,480 --> 00:07:21,880
Untie me right now.

145
00:07:22,720 --> 00:07:24,120
If you let us go,

146
00:07:24,400 --> 00:07:26,200
I'll pretend nothing happened.

147
00:07:30,400 --> 00:07:32,320
If Wang Hong comes later,

148
00:07:32,880 --> 00:07:34,360
I'll let you two go.

149
00:07:35,200 --> 00:07:36,440
If he doesn't come,

150
00:07:37,440 --> 00:07:39,000
you both will die here.

151
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:46,600
Hey.

152
00:07:49,880 --> 00:07:51,280
Don't be afraid. Mom is here.

153
00:07:51,280 --> 00:07:51,920
Hey.

154
00:07:53,040 --> 00:07:53,900
How about this?

155
00:07:54,040 --> 00:07:54,720
How is it?

156
00:07:55,040 --> 00:07:55,880
Is it looser?

157
00:07:56,000 --> 00:07:56,560
Hello.

158
00:07:58,120 --> 00:07:58,760
Wang Hong.

159
00:08:00,200 --> 00:08:02,520
I've tried to help you time and time again.

160
00:08:02,520 --> 00:08:03,760
Are you playing me?

161
00:08:04,800 --> 00:08:05,480
Fine.

162
00:08:06,720 --> 00:08:08,840
I'm giving you one last notice.

163
00:08:09,720 --> 00:08:11,120
Within an hour,

164
00:08:11,440 --> 00:08:14,400
come to the abandoned building in the north of the city.

165
00:08:14,400 --> 00:08:15,640
What you want

166
00:08:15,880 --> 00:08:17,040
is in my hands.

167
00:08:24,480 --> 00:08:25,200
Teng Laohu.

168
00:08:26,440 --> 00:08:27,040
Wang Hong.

169
00:08:27,240 --> 00:08:28,360
Your son is at the abandoned building in the north of the city.

170
00:08:28,360 --> 00:08:30,200
He kidnapped Chen Lu and her daughter.

171
00:08:30,200 --> 00:08:31,120
What are you talking about?

172
00:08:31,120 --> 00:08:31,840
What happened to Xiaohu?

173
00:08:31,840 --> 00:08:33,280
If you still want him to have a way out,

174
00:08:33,280 --> 00:08:33,840
come quickly.

175
00:08:33,840 --> 00:08:34,679
Come alone.

176
00:08:35,039 --> 00:08:36,480
Understood, understood.

177
00:08:36,480 --> 00:08:37,080
Wang Hong,

178
00:08:37,520 --> 00:08:38,480
don't call the police.

179
00:08:38,480 --> 00:08:39,480
Keep Xiaohu calm.

180
00:08:40,200 --> 00:08:42,039
I'll come over right away to take him away.

181
00:08:42,039 --> 00:08:45,570
Don't worry. He definitely won't hurt the mother and daughter.

182
00:08:49,800 --> 00:08:51,330
Master, where are we going?

183
00:08:55,320 --> 00:08:57,120
There's definitely something wrong with Wang Hong's call.

184
00:08:57,120 --> 00:08:58,440
I need to know where he went.

185
00:08:58,440 --> 00:08:59,080
Keep calling.

186
00:08:59,080 --> 00:08:59,920
Dial, dial, dial.

187
00:08:59,920 --> 00:09:00,320
Dial.

188
00:09:01,320 --> 00:09:03,180
I think this matter is not simple.

189
00:09:06,360 --> 00:09:07,280
It went through.

190
00:09:07,280 --> 00:09:07,800
It went through, it went through.

191
00:09:07,800 --> 00:09:08,660
Speakerphone.

192
00:09:11,200 --> 00:09:12,520
I'm at the abandoned building in the suburbs.

193
00:09:12,520 --> 00:09:13,320
Come quickly.

194
00:09:13,600 --> 00:09:15,280
I'll find a way to stall Teng Xiaohu.

195
00:09:15,280 --> 00:09:16,720
At the abandoned building, bro.

196
00:09:16,720 --> 00:09:18,440
I'll notify the bureau for backup.

197
00:09:18,440 --> 00:09:20,000
Have them stand by at the intersection.

198
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:21,200
We'll act together when they arrive.

199
00:09:21,200 --> 00:09:21,930
Understood.

200
00:09:33,360 --> 00:09:34,120
Teng Xiaohu.

201
00:09:34,720 --> 00:09:36,120
Talk to me if you want to talk.

202
00:09:36,120 --> 00:09:37,320
Let the two of them go.

203
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:38,720
Talk?

204
00:09:39,560 --> 00:09:41,200
Now you want to talk?

205
00:09:41,520 --> 00:09:43,240
When you changed hotels without telling me,

206
00:09:43,240 --> 00:09:44,520
why didn't you want to talk?

207
00:09:44,520 --> 00:09:46,560
When you had this brat call the cops on me,

208
00:09:46,560 --> 00:09:48,090
why didn't you want to talk?

209
00:09:50,080 --> 00:09:50,760
Fine.

210
00:09:51,920 --> 00:09:53,640
I'll give you one more chance.

211
00:09:54,080 --> 00:09:56,010
Everything you want is right here.

212
00:09:57,560 --> 00:09:58,480
Want to see it?

213
00:10:00,120 --> 00:10:01,040
Kneel down.

214
00:10:01,240 --> 00:10:02,560
Apologize to me.

215
00:10:03,280 --> 00:10:04,160
Calm down.

216
00:10:04,360 --> 00:10:05,400
Let them go first.

217
00:10:06,080 --> 00:10:07,410
Let's sit down and talk.

218
00:10:07,440 --> 00:10:08,360
Teng Xiaohu.

219
00:10:09,080 --> 00:10:10,140
What are you doing?

220
00:10:11,840 --> 00:10:12,770
Why are you here?

221
00:10:12,960 --> 00:10:14,120
Put the knife down.

222
00:10:14,120 --> 00:10:15,760
Listen to me and come with me.

223
00:10:15,880 --> 00:10:17,080
I'm not leaving.

224
00:10:17,600 --> 00:10:19,240
Teng Laohu. He's here too.

225
00:10:27,240 --> 00:10:27,840
If I leave,

226
00:10:27,840 --> 00:10:29,570
I'll really become a fugitive.

227
00:10:30,160 --> 00:10:31,840
I have the evidence Wang Hong wants.

228
00:10:31,840 --> 00:10:33,520
I'm negotiating with him right now.

229
00:10:33,520 --> 00:10:35,040
If he gives the evidence to the police,

230
00:10:35,040 --> 00:10:36,700
they might let me off the hook.

231
00:10:36,880 --> 00:10:38,200
Can he help you?

232
00:10:38,360 --> 00:10:39,000
If he could help you,

233
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:40,080
would you be like this?

234
00:10:40,080 --> 00:10:41,680
Listen to me and come with me.

235
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:43,320
Leave me alone.

236
00:10:52,840 --> 00:10:53,440
What?

237
00:10:54,680 --> 00:10:55,680
Okay, I got it.

238
00:10:56,080 --> 00:10:57,640
We are heading to the abandoned building.

239
00:10:57,640 --> 00:10:58,320
Suspects Teng Laohu

240
00:10:58,320 --> 00:10:59,640
and Teng Xiaohu are both there.

241
00:10:59,640 --> 00:11:00,120
Yes.

242
00:11:00,680 --> 00:11:02,610
Requesting backup for the arrest.

243
00:11:04,360 --> 00:11:05,520
It's from the Forest Protection Section.

244
00:11:05,520 --> 00:11:06,880
Liu Guangquan confessed.

245
00:11:06,880 --> 00:11:08,200
His boss is Teng Laohu,

246
00:11:08,320 --> 00:11:09,840
involved in illegal timber smuggling.

247
00:11:09,840 --> 00:11:10,680
The car bombing case from years ago

248
00:11:10,680 --> 00:11:12,000
might also be related to him.

249
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:13,720
They are going to arrest Teng Laohu

250
00:11:13,720 --> 00:11:15,240
and hope we can assist in the capture.

251
00:11:15,240 --> 00:11:16,920
Tell the Forest Protection Section

252
00:11:16,920 --> 00:11:19,120
to attack from the west and north sides of the building.

253
00:11:19,120 --> 00:11:20,680
Ensure the safety of Chen Lu, her daughter,

254
00:11:20,680 --> 00:11:21,840
and Wang Hong.

255
00:11:21,960 --> 00:11:22,690
Understood.

256
00:11:39,560 --> 00:11:40,120
Move.

257
00:11:40,240 --> 00:11:43,040
Everyone, pay attention to the hostages' safety.

258
00:11:55,000 --> 00:11:55,600
Clear.

259
00:11:58,640 --> 00:11:59,320
Brother Hu.

260
00:12:03,760 --> 00:12:04,320
Don't come any closer.

261
00:12:04,320 --> 00:12:05,250
No, Teng Xiaohu.

262
00:12:05,560 --> 00:12:08,020
I'll agree to whatever conditions you have.

263
00:12:09,840 --> 00:12:10,760
Teng Xiaohu.

264
00:12:11,320 --> 00:12:12,240
Run, Xiaohu!

265
00:12:12,520 --> 00:12:15,040
I am Teng Laohu.

266
00:12:15,160 --> 00:12:15,880
Arrest me.

267
00:12:16,280 --> 00:12:16,920
I am Teng Laohu.

268
00:12:16,920 --> 00:12:17,480
Cuff him.

269
00:12:37,480 --> 00:12:38,280
Are you okay?

270
00:12:42,480 --> 00:12:43,200
Thank you.

271
00:12:46,640 --> 00:12:47,770
We didn't catch him.

272
00:12:48,080 --> 00:12:49,520
He took a shortcut and ran away.

273
00:12:49,520 --> 00:12:50,440
Are you okay?

274
00:12:50,440 --> 00:12:51,120
I'm fine.

275
00:12:52,560 --> 00:12:53,820
As long as you're okay.

276
00:12:53,920 --> 00:12:54,920
Are you guys okay?

277
00:12:55,040 --> 00:12:55,700
We're fine.

278
00:12:56,200 --> 00:12:58,200
Thank you, Officer Cao and Mr. Wang.

279
00:12:58,320 --> 00:12:58,600
Thank you.

280
00:12:58,600 --> 00:12:59,330
It's my duty.

281
00:12:59,840 --> 00:13:00,520
Lu.

282
00:13:01,280 --> 00:13:03,080
Take Chen Nian and go back first.

283
00:13:03,080 --> 00:13:03,800
Okay.

284
00:13:05,960 --> 00:13:06,760
It's okay now.

285
00:13:07,120 --> 00:13:07,840
It's okay.

286
00:13:13,000 --> 00:13:13,880
Wait a minute.

287
00:13:15,040 --> 00:13:15,920
Wait a minute.

288
00:13:35,400 --> 00:13:36,400
Liu Ming,

289
00:13:37,280 --> 00:13:38,200
do you know him?

290
00:13:40,800 --> 00:13:41,800
I don't know him.

291
00:13:42,880 --> 00:13:44,080
What about Liu Guang?

292
00:13:46,400 --> 00:13:47,730
I don't know him either.

293
00:13:50,920 --> 00:13:51,800
Director Chen,

294
00:13:54,040 --> 00:13:55,080
your arm...

295
00:13:58,760 --> 00:13:59,560
Car accident.

296
00:14:00,200 --> 00:14:01,730
It happened a few years ago.

297
00:14:04,640 --> 00:14:05,370
Officer Cao,

298
00:14:05,680 --> 00:14:06,720
if there's nothing else,

299
00:14:06,720 --> 00:14:08,240
I'll take the child back.

300
00:14:08,240 --> 00:14:09,770
She's freezing and scared.

301
00:14:11,320 --> 00:14:13,380
Thank you. Thanks for your hard work.

302
00:14:13,560 --> 00:14:14,690
Thank you, Mr. Wang.

303
00:14:14,760 --> 00:14:15,920
Thanks for your hard work.

304
00:14:15,920 --> 00:14:17,760
Thanks for your hard work. Thank you.

305
00:14:17,760 --> 00:14:18,360
Thank you.

306
00:14:20,360 --> 00:14:20,890
Let's go.

307
00:14:21,440 --> 00:14:22,970
Were you freezing just now?

308
00:14:23,280 --> 00:14:24,360
Does it hurt?

309
00:14:32,000 --> 00:14:32,800
Teng Chenghu,

310
00:14:33,480 --> 00:14:34,480
regarding you,

311
00:14:34,920 --> 00:14:36,560
since 1985...

312
00:14:36,880 --> 00:14:38,280
The criminal facts of organizing,

313
00:14:38,280 --> 00:14:39,480
illegally logging,

314
00:14:39,960 --> 00:14:42,490
and illegally trading timber for a long time.

315
00:14:42,720 --> 00:14:44,720
Do you have anything else to tell us?

316
00:14:46,080 --> 00:14:46,800
No.

317
00:14:47,240 --> 00:14:48,440
I admit to all of this.

318
00:14:49,080 --> 00:14:49,920
Liu Guang

319
00:14:50,560 --> 00:14:51,890
and his brother Liu Ming

320
00:14:52,040 --> 00:14:53,920
are your subordinates, right?

321
00:14:54,680 --> 00:14:55,120
Yes.

322
00:14:56,560 --> 00:14:58,400
One is responsible for stealing,

323
00:14:58,400 --> 00:15:00,200
and the other for transporting.

324
00:15:03,240 --> 00:15:04,360
Sixteen years ago,

325
00:15:05,120 --> 00:15:07,640
a truck carrying old Korean pine logs

326
00:15:08,080 --> 00:15:10,040
exploded during transport.

327
00:15:10,280 --> 00:15:11,610
Did this batch of timber

328
00:15:12,360 --> 00:15:14,000
end up in your hands later?

329
00:15:15,000 --> 00:15:15,760
Officer Cao,

330
00:15:17,480 --> 00:15:18,800
you can't just pin

331
00:15:18,800 --> 00:15:20,200
every dirty deed on me.

332
00:15:21,480 --> 00:15:23,610
I know about the Korean pine incident.

333
00:15:23,960 --> 00:15:25,690
But it has nothing to do with me.

334
00:15:26,280 --> 00:15:27,440
This batch of timber

335
00:15:28,920 --> 00:15:30,600
belonged to Zhao Zhiguo's family.

336
00:15:30,600 --> 00:15:31,800
You know that, right?

337
00:15:35,040 --> 00:15:36,000
Zhao Zhiguo.

338
00:15:36,600 --> 00:15:38,400
After the accident at his house,

339
00:15:39,200 --> 00:15:40,600
his whole family died.

340
00:15:41,560 --> 00:15:42,880
I thought at the time,

341
00:15:43,280 --> 00:15:45,480
the wood was just sitting there anyway.

342
00:15:47,000 --> 00:15:49,530
I asked Liu Guang and Liu Ming to go take a look.

343
00:15:50,080 --> 00:15:51,480
They came back and told me

344
00:15:51,560 --> 00:15:52,820
they couldn't find it.

345
00:15:59,360 --> 00:16:00,720
Then sixteen years ago,

346
00:16:01,480 --> 00:16:03,740
the explosion at Zhao Zhiguo's factory,

347
00:16:04,160 --> 00:16:05,420
you did it, didn't you?

348
00:16:06,600 --> 00:16:09,660
Officer Cao, you're getting more and more ridiculous.

349
00:16:10,080 --> 00:16:12,320
I wasn't close to Zhao Zhiguo at all.

350
00:16:12,920 --> 00:16:13,880
In business,

351
00:16:14,240 --> 00:16:15,770
we minded our own business.

352
00:16:15,960 --> 00:16:17,720
He did his thing. I did mine.

353
00:16:18,360 --> 00:16:20,160
Everyone in Xinchun knows that.

354
00:16:22,120 --> 00:16:23,580
Let's stop here for today.

355
00:16:24,000 --> 00:16:25,860
We will verify what you just said.

356
00:16:26,520 --> 00:16:27,980
If you remember anything,

357
00:16:28,120 --> 00:16:29,320
report it at any time.

358
00:16:34,560 --> 00:16:35,480
Officer Cao.

359
00:16:36,920 --> 00:16:37,880
Let me ask you.

360
00:16:37,880 --> 00:16:39,120
My son Xiaohu,

361
00:16:39,120 --> 00:16:40,120
is there any news about him?
